SUMMARY:Sikh Center of Oregon Langar: Sunday Langar
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Farms\nCost: FREE always\nInfo: Begins at 10:3
 0am and continues onward. The one-hour calendar block is a start-time remi
 nder\, not a claimed ending time.\nAddress: 17514 SW Scholls Ferry Rd\, Be
 averton\, OR 97007\nPhone: 971-217-8577\nWebsite: https://sikhcenteroforeg
 on.com/\nDetails: Free vegetarian meals based on 500-year-old Sikh traditi
 on (Langar). 150-200 people served weekly. All welcome regardless of relig
 ion. Remove shoes\, cover head (scarves provided). Food served in separate
  area - no need to attend religious service.
